%% Remote thin-client + headless server (Free Switch, JPEG in / SEGMENT out)
%% Render: https://mermaid.live or VS Code "Mermaid" preview

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 使用者
    participant F as 前端<br/>(Thin client)
    participant S as 伺服器<br/>(LiveCC host)

    rect rgba(80, 80, 100, 0.15)
        note over U, F: Free Switch · 不重連 TCP
        U->>F: 開 Free Switch
        F->>F: 雙路 VideoCapture 常駐<br/>grab/retrieve · 切換僅改 active_source
    end

    U->>F: 開始播報
    F->>S: HELLO
    S-->>F: ACK
    F->>S: START (mode, query)

    rect rgba(80, 100, 80, 0.12)
        note over F, S: 推論迴圈
        loop 每幀 / 依送帧節奏
            F->>S: FRAME (JPEG)
            S->>S: imdecode → buffer → LiveCC
            S-->>F: SEGMENT (解說文字)
        end
    end

    U->>F: 切換來源 (webcam / VR / dual)
    F->>F: set_active_source（同一條 TCP）

    U->>F: 停止
    F->>S: STOP
    S-->>F: (連線可關閉或由客戶端斷開)
